  <h2>Sustainability Without Compromise</h2>
  <p>Mature brands are moving beyond "greenwashing." As your <strong>Supply Chain Partner</strong>, Fitclo provides technical data to prove that our recycled materials perform as well as (or better than) virgin nylon.</p>
  
  <h3>Nylon 6,6 vs. Standard Polyester</h3>
  <p>Our R&D team has perfected the use of recycled Nylon 6,6 (sourced from post-industrial waste). It offers superior elasticity, softer hand-feel, and better colorfastness compared to traditional recycled polyester. This is the material of choice for "high-end" yoga collections.</p>
  
  <h3>GRS Traceability & Documentation</h3>
  <p>For your <strong>Global Logistics</strong> and marketing compliance, we provide full GRS (Global Recycled Standard) certification and TC (Transaction Certificates) for every order. This ensures your sustainability claims are legally defensible in all major markets.</p>

  <h3>Inventory Management of Eco-Yarns</h3>
  <p>We maintain a dedicated <strong>Inventory Management</strong> system for sustainable yarns, allowing our partners to pivot to eco-friendly collections with the same speed and reliability as our standard lines.</p>
</GuideLayout>
